              <td style="width: 91%; vertical-align: top;">
                <div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25;">on an as adjusted basis, giving effect to the sale of&#160; an aggregate of (i) 117,930 ordinary shares, (ii) pre-funded warrants to purchase up to 183,300 ordinary shares, and (iii) in the
                  concurrent private placement the unregistered warrants to purchase up to 301,230 at an offering price of $9.00 ordinary share and unregistered warrant and an offering price of $8.999 per pre-funded warrant and unregistered warrant, after
                  deducting the placement agent fees and estimated offering expenses payable by us, resulting in net proceeds of approximately $2.3 million.</div>
              </td>
            </tr>

        </table>
        <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt; line-height: 1.25;">&#160;</div>
