                  <td style="width: 92%; vertical-align: top;">
                    <div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25;">initiate preclinical studies and clinical trials for any additional drug candidates that we may pursue in the future;</div>
                    <div style="line-height: 1.25;"><font style="line-height: 1.25;">&#160;</font></div>
                  </td>
