          <div>
            <div style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: bold;">DESCRIPTION OF SUBSCRIPTION RIGHTS<a name="RIGHTS"><!--Anchor--></a></div>
            <div style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.25;">&#160;</div>
            <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt; line-height: 1.25;">We may issue subscription rights to purchase our ordinary shares. These subscription rights may be issued independently or together with any other security offered hereby
              and may or may not be transferable by the shareholder receiving the subscription rights in such offering. In connection with any offering of subscription rights, we may enter into a standby arrangement with one or more underwriters or other
              purchasers pursuant to which the underwriters or other purchasers may be required to purchase any securities remaining unsubscribed for after such offering.</div>
            <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 28.35pt; line-height: 1.25;">&#160;</div>
            <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt; line-height: 1.25;">The prospectus supplement relating to any subscription rights we offer, if any, will, to the extent applicable, include specific terms relating to the offering, including
              some or all of the following:</div>
