                  </td>
                  <td style="width: 92%; vertical-align: top;">
                    <div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25;">the date, if any, after which, and the price at which, we may, at our option, redeem the series of debt securities pursuant to any optional redemption provisions;</div>
                  </td>
                </tr>

            </table>
            <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: -36pt; margin-left: 72pt; line-height: 1.25;">&#160;</div>
            <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;">

